  sequence:
  - name: Cherry
    character: 0
    speakerSprite: {fileID: -2069185945796123168, guid: 337ce6c3564cc8a4fb044661efac34b3, type: 3}
    speakerName: Cherry
    content:
    - Hey, Damson. Are we doing another quest today?
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 0
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - name: Damson
    character: 1
    speakerSprite: {fileID: -2733444605593320565, guid: dc0969557c4cf8f40bb757f8cb06197d, type: 3}
    speakerName: Damson
    content:
    - Uh, sure. Just one thing...
    - Could I, uh... borrow 100 gold?
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 0
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - name: Cherry
    character: 0
    speakerSprite: {fileID: -2069185945796123168, guid: 337ce6c3564cc8a4fb044661efac34b3, type: 3}
    speakerName: Cherry
    content:
    - Huh!? You're asking me for gold!?
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 0
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - name: Damson
    character: 1
    speakerSprite: {fileID: -2733444605593320565, guid: dc0969557c4cf8f40bb757f8cb06197d, type: 3}
    speakerName: Damson
    content:
    - Look, the armourer's selling a piece of equipment and I'm just 100 gold short.
    - You've got some quest gold, right? I'll pay you back after our next quest.
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 0
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - name: Cherry
    character: 0
    speakerSprite: {fileID: -2069185945796123168, guid: 337ce6c3564cc8a4fb044661efac34b3, type: 3}
    speakerName: Cherry
    content:
    - Weren't you the one calling me broke last week? And now look who's grovelling
      for cash...
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 0
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - name: Damson
    character: 1
    speakerSprite: {fileID: -2733444605593320565, guid: dc0969557c4cf8f40bb757f8cb06197d, type: 3}
    speakerName: Damson
    content:
    - Hey! We're teammates, aren't we!? Come on, I need to get it before he changes
      his stock.
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 0
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - name: Cherry
    character: 0
    speakerSprite: {fileID: -2069185945796123168, guid: 337ce6c3564cc8a4fb044661efac34b3, type: 3}
    speakerName: Cherry
    content:
    - Ugh... Fine. I've got some gold in the bank. You could use that.
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 0
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - name: Damson
    character: 1
    speakerSprite: {fileID: -2733444605593320565, guid: dc0969557c4cf8f40bb757f8cb06197d, type: 3}
    speakerName: Damson
    content:
    - Alright. We're off to town, then.
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 0
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
